kunzite: Adreno 710 probe, read-only steps 1-3 of the GPU port map (main repo ios/gpu-plan.md),
after HackiOS redwood_adreno.c. Boot-arg kgpu=N (N<=3) runs them once on a thread, kgpu_delay
seconds after boot (default 60), announcing each group of reads and waiting kgpu_pause ms
(default 1500) first. 1: GCC GPU branches + GPLL0 votes, cmd-db ARC gfx.lvl/cx.lvl/mx.lvl with
their level tables; 2: QFPROM speed/gaming bins -> FDT pwrlevel bin; 3: GPU_CC PLLs, RCGs,
branches, CX/GX GDSCs (only if GCC gpu_cfg_ahb is on). Writes nothing; off without kgpu,
refuses gpu=1.

